  <!--原中文: '这是一座雕刻成一个可怕生物的石制雕像。这个生物比普通人小，看起来像是一个拙劣雕刻师的作品。但是，当你注意到雕像的眼睛、耳朵和爪子时，这座雕像似乎活了过来，你感觉有一双眼睛在注视着你，让你感觉毛骨悚然。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'This statue is made of stone and shaped to look like a terrifying creature. The statue is smaller than an average person and has the look of a rough cut and quality, though, you notice the eyes, ears, and claws seems to have finer detail.
	
As you drawn near the statue, an eerie glint from the eyes of the stone sentinel seems to follow you, and you get the feeling that you are being watched.',更新于2026-02-14-->
